The following files under patches/vllm/ are modified copies of files from the
vllm/vllm-openai:inkling-2-mini image (vLLM 0.1.dev25855+g7cb5dae22), changed to run on
NVIDIA sm_80 (Ampere) GPUs and to run faster there; patches/sm80.diff shows every change:

  models/inkling2/quant_config.py
  models/inkling2/nvidia/attention.py
  models/inkling2/nvidia/dspark.py
  models/inkling2/nvidia/loop.py
  models/inkling2/nvidia/ops/attention_sm90.py
  models/inkling2/nvidia/ops/conv_mix.py
  models/inkling2/nvidia/ops/gemv.py
  models/inkling2/nvidia/ops/linear.py
  models/inkling2/nvidia/ops/moe_sm90.py

The Triton kernels in site/inkling_sm80_ops.py and site/inkling_sm80_moe_align.py are written
for this repository and reproduce the behaviour of the corresponding vLLM operations.
